---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base>
  <section class="page">
    <h1>Formation</h1>
    <p class="quote">“As therefore you received Christ Jesus the Lord, so live in him, rooted and built up in him and established in the faith...”</p>
    <p class="subtitle">Colossians 2:6–7</p>

    <h2>Faith Formation at Christ the King</h2>
    <p>Faith formation is a lifelong journey of growing in our relationship with Jesus Christ and deepening our understanding of the Catholic faith.</p>
    <p>Through prayer, Scripture, religious education, and community, we learn to live out the Gospel and grow as disciples of Christ at every stage of life.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>Faith formation for elementary grades. Sacramental preparation for First Reconciliation and First Eucharist is listed on the Sacraments page.</p>
    <p>Contact Leslie Soell, (719) 542-9248 ext. 113, lsoell@ctkpueblo.org.</p>

    <h2>Middle and high school</h2>
    <p>Discipleship for middle and high school youth. Confirmation preparation is for incoming 7th and 8th grade and high school youth who still need the sacrament, after one year of formation.</p>
    <p>Contact Aden Casarez, ext. 114.</p>

    <h2>Adults</h2>
    <p>Adult formation includes Sunday sessions, small groups, and Bible studies. Call for the current schedule.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Men's Bible Study, Tuesdays, 9:00–10:00 a.m.</li>
      <li>Women's Bible Study, Wednesdays, 9:00–11:00 a.m.</li>
      <li>Sunday Formation for All</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Contact Sarah Nelson, ext. 121, snelson@ctkpueblo.org.</p>

    <h2>Register</h2>
    <p>Registration for Formation for All is open.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://forms.ministryforms.net/embed.aspx?formId=45ec37d1-842d-48f3-a64b-2b0b16ebd5f0">Registration form</a></li>
      <li><a href="/docs/ffa-calendar.pdf">2026–2027 calendar</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Parish calendar</h2>
    <p>Click an event to add it to your Google Calendar.</p>
    <div class="calendar">
      <iframe
        src="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/embed?src=christthekingpueblo%40gmail.com&amp;ctz=America/Denver"
        title="Parish calendar"
        loading="lazy"
      ></iframe>
    </div>

    <h2>Resources for Growing in Faith</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://bible.usccb.org/">Daily readings</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://formed.org/">Formed</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.usccb.org/prayers/prayers-rosary">Prayers of the Rosary</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.usccb.org/how-to-pray-the-rosary">How to Pray the Rosary</a></li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Catechism of the Catholic Church</h3>
    <p>Explore the teachings of the Catholic Church on faith, the sacraments, Christian living, and prayer.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://usccb.cld.bz/Catechism-of-the-Catholic-Church2/">Read the Catechism Online</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 12px 32px 64px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  h1 {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .quote {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .subtitle {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold);
    font-family: "Source Sans 3", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  h3 {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    font-family: "Source Sans 3", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  p {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  ul {
    list-style-type: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin: 0.4rem 0 1.25rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .calendar {
    margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  }

  .calendar iframe {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 600px;
    border: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .page {
      padding: 8px 4px 40px;
    }

    .calendar iframe {
      height: 450px;
    }
  }
</style>


